# Context-trimming for cloud/cloud.Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <dockerfile>.dockerignore).
# Keep ONLY the build artifacts; drop the heavy source install, git, caches.
# NB: single-level `web/apps/*/node_modules` excludes the SOURCE installs but NOT
# the standalone's own nested node_modules (web/apps/helix/.next/standalone/...).
.git
**/.turbo
web/node_modules
web/apps/*/node_modules
web/packages/*/*/node_modules
web/apps/*/.next/cache
**/*.tsbuildinfo
